Output demo/ghostdeck.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "FiraCode Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 12
Set Width 1100
Set Height 620
Set Padding 0
Set Framerate 15
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./ghostdeck -file demo/slides.md"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Right
Sleep 2.5s
Sleep 300ms
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
